			"notes": "**For Minecraft 1.16.4**\n\nAdds a barn structure!\n\n- There are 2 new building blocks:\n  - A rough barn planks block that looks like warped oak planks.\n  - A smooth bright red block.\n- Barns will have a random assortment of hay piles, platforms and lanterns.\n  - They are slightly more rare than villages.\n  - Barns may have hidden loot.\n  - They will very rarely be broken (completely *useless*).\n- If a barn has a platform, it will also include a path and villager house.\n  - The house includes a villager.\n  - The villager keeps their prized possessions in a chest near the entrance.\n- All structures will adjust to the terrain height."
		},
